        {
          "path": "_m/9/m/g/v/catalina-casino-wp/catalina-casino-avalon-santa-c.jpg",
          "filename": "Catalina Casino, Avalon, Santa Catalina Island, California (8660060614).jpg",
          "caption": "The Catalina Casino is located in Avalon on Catalina Island off the coast of Los Angeles. It is the most recognisable landmark in the City of Avalon. It contains a theatre, a ballroom and a museum. The Catalina Casino gets its name from the Italian language, where “casino” means a gathering place. There is no gambling at this facility\nen.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catalina_Casino\n\nen.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Text_of_Creative_Commons_...",
          "alt": "The Catalina Casino is located in Avalon on Catalina Island off the coast of Los Angeles. It is the most recognisable landmark in the City of Avalon. It contains a theatre, a ballroom and a museum. The Catalina Casino gets its name from the Italian language, where “casino” means a gathering place. There is no gambling at this facility\nen.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catalina_Casino\n\nen.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Text_of_Creative_Commons_...",
